<title>ITALY: SOCCER-ITALIAN FIRST DIVISION SUMMARIES.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ITALIAN FIRST DIVISION SUMMARIES.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1996-10-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summaries of Italian first division</p>
<p>soccer matches played on Sunday:</p>
<p>Fiorentina 1 (Robbiati 87th minute) Milan 0. Halftime 0-0.</p>
<p>Attendance: 39,000</p>
<p>Inter 3 (Zamorano 4 and 54, Zanetti 22) Parma 1 (Crespo 1).</p>
<p>2-1. 48,000</p>
<p>Napoli 3 (Caccia 43 - penalty, Aglietti 51, Cruz 65) Bologna 2</p>
<p>(Nervo 21, Bresciani 74). 1-1. 45,000</p>
<p>Perugia 2 (Allegri 43, Negri 70) Udinese 1 (Poggi 6). 1-1.</p>
<p>20,000</p>
<p>Piacenza 2 (Luiso 41 - penalty, Scienza 56) Verona 0. 1-0.</p>
<p>10,000</p>
<p>Reggiana 1 (Tovalieri 33 - penalty) Sampdoria 1 (Mancini 13).</p>
<p>1-1. 11,000</p>
<p>Vicenza 2 (Otero 34, Murgita 62) Cagliari 0. 1-0. 15,500</p>
